# CPU Monitoring

CPU monitoring measures utilization, load, user CPU, system CPU, idle CPU, and wait time. Sustained high usage can indicate bottlenecks.

## Key Points

- Understand the purpose of cpu monitoring.
- Identify relevant monitoring measurements.
- Use monitoring information for detection, analysis, and troubleshooting.

## Example Flow

```text
System → Collect Metrics → Analyze → Visualize → Alert → Respond
```
